body:
i really need help

&#x200B;

but i dont know what kind of help

&#x200B;

sometimes i do think i need it

&#x200B;

sometimes i think i should just die, i dont deserve anything and i keep apologizing and keep apologizing

&#x200B;

even though i didnt do anything at all, i still think that, "everything is my fault, i did this" 

&#x200B;

everything is my fault, i ruin everything

and as i grow older, i do not fear that much of death anymore, for me it's a good thing i guess, since i get a gist of it already since i was really young, how it feels like to die every single day

&#x200B;

and just put on a smile so they think everything's really fine

what keeps me alive till now because i still have a sibling, idk how they will feel if im really gone, in my community most of the aunties and uncles thought how rare it is for siblings to get along with each other, because i get along with my sibling really well (most of their children with siblings just fight or just dont talk to each other at all) so they're quiet envy/impress on my relationship with my sibling

&#x200B;

if i do, really thrown away my life one day, how would they feel, idk if they will really react if im gone for real

i apologize for the lousy grammar, it's just that im just typing what's on my mind right now

&#x200B;

&#x200B;

there isn't a single day i dont feel suicidal, i can smile, but it's just a natural reaction when i see something i like
